sequenceDiagram
    participant Svc as Application Service
    participant DB as Postgres (same transaction)
    participant Worker as Webhook Outbox Worker
    participant Endpoint as Subscriber Endpoint

    Svc->>DB: business mutation + outbox event row (PENDING) — one transaction
    DB-->>Svc: commit (both persisted atomically)

    loop poll every 5s
        Worker->>DB: claim a batch of PENDING events -> PROCESSING
        Worker->>Endpoint: POST event payload (HMAC-SHA256 signed)
        alt 2xx response
            Endpoint-->>Worker: 200 OK
            Worker->>DB: mark DELIVERED
        else delivery failed, attempts < 5
            Endpoint--xWorker: error / timeout
            Worker->>DB: mark PENDING again (retry)
        else attempts >= 5
            Worker->>DB: mark FAILED
        end
    end
    Note over Worker,DB: Worker crash mid-delivery -> event stuck in PROCESSING -> reclaimed as STALE after 2min, retried
